     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about a routine",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about a specific day, use på: på mandag («on Monday»), på søndag («on Sunday»). English also uses a preposition in these examples.",
      "Våkner is «wake up» and står opp is «get up»: they describe two different moments. The Norwegian present keeps the same form with jeg and du."
     ],
